@startuml
autonumber
actor "Client/UI" as Client
actor "Data Ingestion Service" as DataIngestion

participant "Kong Gateway" as Kong
participant "HTTP ClusterIP Service" as HTTPService
participant "HealthController" as HealthCtrl
participant "Kafka Broker" as Kafka
participant "PduProcessingService" as Service
participant "PduParserFactory" as Factory
participant "EntityStatePduParser" as EntityParser
participant "FirePduParser" as FireParser
participant "DefaultPduParser" as DefaultParser
participant "EntityStateRepository" as EntityRepo
participant "FireEventRepository" as FireRepo
participant "PostgreSQL DB" as DB

== Kafka Message Processing Flow (Concurrent) ==
note over Kafka, Service : Concurrent processing with 3 threads\nConsumer Group: processing-group

DataIngestion -> Kafka : Publishes JSON PDU to "dis-pdus" topic
activate Kafka

Kafka -> Service : Delivers EntityStatePdu JSON message (Thread 1)
activate Service

Service -> Service : Parse JSON with ObjectMapper
activate Service
note right: Validates message structure\nand extracts PDU type
Service --> Service : Extract type: "EntityStatePdu"
deactivate Service

Service -> Factory : getParser("EntityStatePdu")
activate Factory
Factory --> Service : Returns EntityStatePduParser
deactivate Factory

Service -> EntityParser : parseAndStore(jsonMessage)
activate EntityParser

EntityParser -> EntityParser : Deserialize JSON to DTO
EntityParser -> EntityParser : Create EntityStateRecord
EntityParser -> EntityRepo : save(record)
activate EntityRepo
EntityRepo -> DB : INSERT INTO entity_state_record...
activate DB
DB --> EntityRepo : Transaction committed
deactivate DB
EntityRepo --> EntityParser : Record saved
deactivate EntityRepo

EntityParser --> Service : Processing completed
deactivate EntityParser
deactivate Service

== Parallel Processing: Fire PDU (Thread 2) ==
Kafka -> Service : Delivers FirePdu JSON message (Thread 2)
activate Service

Service -> Factory : getParser("FirePdu")
activate Factory
Factory --> Service : Returns FirePduParser
deactivate Factory

Service -> FireParser : parseAndStore(jsonMessage)
activate FireParser
FireParser -> FireRepo : save(fireEventRecord)
activate FireRepo
FireRepo -> DB : INSERT INTO fire_event_record...
FireRepo --> FireParser : Record saved
deactivate FireRepo
FireParser --> Service : Processing completed
deactivate FireParser
deactivate Service

== Error Handling: Unknown PDU Type (Thread 3) ==
Kafka -> Service : Delivers UnknownPdu JSON message (Thread 3)
activate Service

Service -> Factory : getParser("UnknownPdu")
activate Factory
Factory --> Service : Returns DefaultPduParser
deactivate Factory

Service -> DefaultParser : parseAndStore(jsonMessage)
activate DefaultParser
note right: Logs warning for unknown type\nwithout halting pipeline
DefaultParser -> DefaultParser : Log warning message
DefaultParser --> Service : Graceful handling completed
deactivate DefaultParser
deactivate Service

deactivate Kafka

== Health Check Flow (Public) ==
Client -> Kong : GET /api/processing/health
activate Kong
Kong -> HTTPService : Route to ClusterIP port 8080
activate HTTPService
HTTPService -> HealthCtrl : healthCheck()
activate HealthCtrl
HealthCtrl --> HTTPService : ResponseEntity("Service is up...")
deactivate HealthCtrl
HTTPService --> Kong : HTTP 200 OK
deactivate HTTPService
Kong --> Client : Health status response
deactivate Kong

== Protected Endpoint Flow (Kong Gateway Authentication) ==
Client -> Kong : GET /api/processing/management\nAuthorization: Bearer {jwt_token}
activate Kong
Kong -> Kong : Validate Firebase JWT token
activate Kong
note right: Custom jwt-firebase plugin\nvalidates token with Firebase
Kong --> Kong : Extract user claims
deactivate Kong

Kong -> HTTPService : Forward authenticated request\nwith user headers
activate HTTPService
HTTPService -> Service : Process management request
activate Service
Service --> HTTPService : Management response
deactivate Service
HTTPService --> Kong : Response with data
deactivate HTTPService
Kong --> Client : Authenticated response
deactivate Kong

@enduml